  "scatter": {
    "_about": "Biome weighting for HarvestNode resources (island_scatter._plant_family) and the per-island node target. role_share splits the target across tree/bush/rock/plant/wild_grass; weights multiply a role's acceptance in that biome (0 = never), normalised against the highest weight for that role so the target count holds.",
