      "per_ha": 350.0,
      "min": 450,
      "max": 600,
      "specials": 9,
      "_about": "HarvestNode target per island: per_ha of land, clamped to [min,max]; role_share splits it. Plan P4: home 450-600, unstable 500-750; the max keeps a 12 ha island at 600."
    },
